It was blank

187
00:23:20,317 --> 00:23:23,137
記憶の彼方
Beyond the memory

188
00:23:23,137 --> 00:23:25,957
ドラマみたいだ
Like a drama

189
00:23:25,957 --> 00:23:27,137
鼓動が鳴った
My heartbeat echoed

190
00:23:27,657 --> 00:23:34,077
足跡を辿って 分かれ道で立ち止まってる
Following footsteps, stopping at a crossroads

191
00:23:34,297 --> 00:23:40,917
八方美人で誤魔化した 燦きは霧の向こう
The glittering, disguised by being nice to everyone, is beyond the fog

192
00:23:41,277 --> 00:23:49,697
ホントのこと教えて ホントの自分に出会えた時
Tell me the truth, when I met my true self

193
00:23:50,917 --> 00:23:56,597
愛し愛される未来が きっと訪れる
Loving and being loved, the future will surely come

194
00:23:57,157 --> 00:24:03,757
