重ねた色が涙で流れて 虹色になるから
Because the overlapping colors flow with tears and become a rainbow

200
00:24:53,197 --> 00:25:01,097
見つめていたい 透明なガラスのキャンバス
I want to gaze at the transparent glass canvas

201
00:26:14,384 --> 00:26:23,584
もう一度さ 声を聴かせてよ めくれないままでいる 夏の日のカレンダー
Once more, let me hear your voice... The calendar of that summer day remains unflipped.

202
00:26:24,084 --> 00:26:32,084
ただいまってさ 笑ってみせてよ 送り先もわからない 忘れものばかりだ
Say 'I'm home' and smile for me... It's all forgotten things, whose destination we don't even know.

203
00:26:32,584 --> 00:26:48,084
ココロが壊れる音が聴こえて どれだけ君を愛していたか知って もう二度とは増やせない 思い出を抱いて 生きて
I heard the sound of a heart breaking, and learned how much I loved you. Holding memories that we can no longer increase, I live on.

204
00:26:48,584 --> 00:27:02,584
デイバイデイ どんなスピードで追いかけたら また君と巡り逢えるだろう
Day by day... At what speed should I chase you, so I can meet you once more?

205
00:27:03,084 --> 00:27:12,084
寄り添った日々 生きている意味 くれたのは君なんだよ
You are the one who gave meaning to the days we stayed close.

206
00:27:13,084 --> 00:27:22,584
だから いつもココロで想い続けてる まだ僕の声は聴こえてる？
That's why I keep thinking of you in my heart always. Can you still hear my voice?

207
00:27:23,084 --> 00:27:32,584
止まらない日々 君に逢う旅 よく似合う笑み浮かべて 待ってて
Unstoppable days. Every time I meet you, wear your fitting smile and wait for me.

208
00:27:33,084 --> 00:27:45,084
言えなかった胸の奥の言葉 いまなら ありのまま君に渡せる
The words deep in my chest that I couldn't say—now I can hand them to you just as they are.

209
00:27:47,584 --> 00:27:57,584
囁けばさ 届けられた距離 ゼロセンチの指先で 渡せた気になってた
If I whispered, the distance was closed... I felt as though I could hand it to you with fingertip distance of zero centimeters.

210
00:27:58,084 --> 00:28:06,584
どうしてかな 離れている方が 言葉溢れだすのは いまさらと笑って
Why is it? That words overflow more when we're apart—laughing at how it's too late now.

211
00:28:07,584 --> 00:28:21,584
君だけ見つけた いつかの流星 どんな願いを浮かべていたのかな あの日君が見上げてた
The shooting star I found just for you one day—what kind of wish were you picturing on that day you looked up?

212
00:28:22,084 --> 00:28:25,584
藍色の先を見つめ
Gazing into the indigo blue beyond...

213
00:28:26,084 --> 00:28:36,584
デイバイデイ 幾億年の距離をこえて 輝きを伝う星のように
Day by day, crossing distances of billions of light-years, like a star passing down its brilliance...

214
00:28:37,084 --> 00:28:45,584
変わらない愛 確かなヒカリ 届くまで願い続ける
An unchanging love, a certain light—I will keep wishing until it reaches you.

215
00:28:46,584 --> 00:28:56,584
だから いつか僕ら巡り逢えたなら 輝きの中 待ち合わせよう
That's why, if we ever cross paths again, let's meet in the midst of the radiance.

216
00:28:57,084 --> 00:29:06,584
君が迷子にならないように 瞬きもせず 照らして待ってる
So that you don't get lost, I'll keep shining and waiting without even blinking.

217
00:29:07,084 --> 00:29:19,584
消えやしない 君がくれた温もり 抱きしめ 僕はいまを生きていくから
Embracing the warmth you gave me that will never fade, I will live on in the present.

218
00:29:27,084 --> 00:29:32,084
名前を呼ぶよ 来る日も来る日も
I will call your name, day in and day out.

219
00:29:32,584 --> 00:29:40,584
たえず叫ぶよ あのままの二人でいようよ
I will keep calling out—let's stay just as the two of us were.

220
00:29:41,584 --> 00:29:52,084
デイバイデイ どんなスピードで追いかけたら また君と巡り逢えるだろう
Day by day... At what speed should I chase you, so I can meet you once more?

221
00:29:52,584 --> 00:30:00,584
わけあえた日々 季節はふいに 君だけを乗せ 彼方へ
The days we shared, the seasons suddenly carrying only you to the distance...

222
00:31:03,190 --> 00:31:06,590
どこから春が巡り来るのか
Where does spring come wandering from...

223
00:31:06,890 --> 00:31:11,190
知らず知らず大人になった
Before I knew it, I had grown up.

224
00:31:11,890 --> 00:31:15,890
見上げた先には燕が飛んでた
Looking up, I saw swallows flying by.

225
00:31:16,190 --> 00:31:18,890
気のない顔で
With indifferent faces.

226
00:31:19,190 --> 00:31:22,890
もしもわたしに翼があれば
If only I had wings...

227
00:31:23,190 --> 00:31:27,190
願う度に悲しみに暮れた
Every time I wished, I was plunged into sadness.

228
00:31:27,890 --> 00:31:34,590
さよなら 100年先でまた会いましょう 心配しないで
Goodbye, let's meet again a hundred years from now, so don't worry.

229
00:31:35,590 --> 00:31:39,190
いつの間にか 花が落ちた
Before I knew it, the flowers had fallen.

230
00:31:39,590 --> 00:31:43,190
誰かがわたしに嘘をついた
Someone lied to me.

231
00:31:43,590 --> 00:31:46,890
土砂降りでも構わず飛んでく
Flying on regardless of the pouring rain...

232
00:31:46,890 --> 00:31:51,190
その力が欲しかった
I wanted that strength.

233
00:31:53,590 --> 00:32:01,190
誰かと恋に落ちて また砕けて やがて離れ離れ
Falling in love with someone, breaking apart, and eventually drifting away.

234
00:32:01,590 --> 00:32:08,890
口の中はたと血が滲んで 空に唾を吐く
Blood suddenly seeps in my mouth as I spit into the sky.

235
00:32:09,590 --> 00:32:17,190
瞬け 羽を広げ 気儘に飛べ どこまでもゆけ
Twinkle, spread your wings, fly as you please, and go anywhere.

236
00:32:17,590 --> 00:32:25,590
100年先も憶えてるかな 知らねえけれど さよーならまたいつか！
Will I remember a hundred years from now? Who knows, but goodbye until next time!

237
00:32:35,590 --> 00:32:40,190
しぐるるやしぐるる町へ歩み入る
Walking through a drizzling town in a passing shower.

238
00:32:40,590 --> 00:32:44,190
そこかしこで袖触れる
Our sleeves brushing against each other here and there.

239
00:32:44,590 --> 00:32:51,190
見上げた先には何も居なかった ああ居なかった
Looking up, there was nothing there... nothing at all.

240
00:32:52,590 --> 00:32:56,190
したり顔で 触らないで
Don't touch me with that smug face.

241
00:32:56,590 --> 00:33:00,190
背中を殴りつける的外れ
An off-target blow beating against my back.

242
00:33:00,590 --> 00:33:07,190
人が宣う地獄の実にこそ わたしは春を見る
Beyond the hell people speak of, that is where I see spring.

243
00:33:10,590 --> 00:33:18,190
誰かを愛したくて でも痛くて いつしか雨霰
Wanting to love someone, but it hurts, and before I knew it, it's raining hail.

244
00:33:18,590 --> 00:33:25,590
繋がれてた縄を握りしめて しかと噛みちぎる
Grasping the rope that bound us, biting right through it.

245
00:33:26,190 --> 00:33:33,590
貫け 狙い定め 蓋し虎へ どこまでもゆけ
Pierce through, aim true, toward the sure tiger, go anywhere.

246
00:33:34,190 --> 00:33:43,190
100年先のあなたに会いたい 消え失せるなよ さよーならまたいつか！
I want to meet you a hundred years from now, don't you dare vanish, goodbye until next time!

247
00:33:43,590 --> 00:33:49,190
今恋に落ちて また砕けて 離れ離れ
Falling in love now, breaking apart again, drifting away.

248
00:33:49,590 --> 00:33:57,590
口の中はたと血が滲んで 空に唾を吐く
Blood suddenly seeps in my mouth as I spit into the sky.

249
00:33:58,590 --> 00:34:05,590
今羽を広げ 気儘に飛べ どこまでもゆけ
Now spread your wings, fly as you please, and go anywhere.

250
00:34:06,190 --> 00:34:14,190
生まれた日からわたしでいたんだ 知らなかっただろ さよーならまたいつか！
I've been myself since the day I was born, you probably didn't know, goodbye until next time!

251
00:34:35,590 --> 00:34:39,590
君を泣かすから だから一緒には居れないな
I'll make you cry, so we can't be together.

252
00:34:40,590 --> 00:34:44,590
君を泣かすから 早く忘れて欲しいんだ
I'll make you cry, so I want you to forget me soon.

253
00:34:45,590 --> 00:34:49,190
人間だからね たまには違うものも食べたいね
We're human after all, sometimes we want to eat something different.

254
00:34:49,590 --> 00:34:53,590
君を泣かすから そう君を泣かすから
Because I'll make you cry, yes, because I'll make you cry.

255
00:34:53,890 --> 00:34:58,590
でも味気ないんだよね
But it's so dull and tasteless, isn't it...

256
00:34:58,890 --> 00:35:03,190
会いたくなんだよね
I just want to meet you.

257
00:35:03,577 --> 00:35:11,777
大体曖昧なんだよね 愛の存在証明なんて 君が教えてくれないか
The proof of love's existence is so vague... Won't you teach me?

258
00:35:12,377 --> 00:35:20,877
何十回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような愛してるを並べてみて
Line up 'I love you's that you couldn't obtain even after spending dozens of nights,

259
00:35:21,377 --> 00:35:30,777
何十回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような最高のフルコースを頂戴
Give me the ultimate full course meal, the kind you can't get even after spending dozens of nights.

260
00:35:40,577 --> 00:35:49,577
君を泣かすから きっと一生は無理だよね 君を泣かすから 胸がとても痛くなんだ
Because I make you cry, a lifetime together is surely impossible, right? Because I make you cry, my chest aches so much.

261
00:35:50,377 --> 00:35:54,077
人間だからね たまには分かり合えなくなって
Because we're human, sometimes we fail to understand each other.

262
00:35:54,377 --> 00:35:58,377
君を泣かすから また君を泣かすから
Because I make you cry, and again because I make you cry.

263
00:35:58,777 --> 00:36:03,377
でも自信がないんだよね 変わりたくないんだよね
Yet I lack confidence... I don't want to change.

264
00:36:03,777 --> 00:36:07,777
君以外会いたくないんだよね なんて勝手だね
I don't want to see anyone else besides you... how selfish of me.

265
00:36:08,377 --> 00:36:12,777
大体曖昧だったよね 愛の存在証明なんて
The proof of love's existence was mostly vague all along.

266
00:36:13,277 --> 00:36:16,777
君がそこに居るのにね
Even though you are right there...

267
00:36:17,777 --> 00:36:26,077
何百回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような愛してるを並べてみて
Line up 'I love you's that you couldn't obtain even after spending hundreds of nights,

268
00:36:26,577 --> 00:36:35,377
何百回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような最高のフルコースを頂戴
Give me the ultimate full course meal, the kind you can't get even after spending hundreds of nights.

269
00:36:36,077 --> 00:36:44,577
離れないで傍に居てくれたのは 結局君一人だったよね
In the end, the only one who stayed by my side and didn't leave was you.

270
00:36:45,077 --> 00:36:53,777
涙のスパイスは君の胸に 残ってしまうだろうけど
Though the spice of tears will likely remain in your heart...

271
